  <entry>
    <title>CMake语法学习</title>
    <link href="/2026/05/25/CMake%E8%AF%AD%E6%B3%95%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/"/>
    <url>/2026/05/25/CMake%E8%AF%AD%E6%B3%95%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>CMake语法学习</p><span id="more"></span><h1 id="CMake语法"><a href="#CMake语法" class="headerlink" title="CMake语法"></a>CMake语法</h1><h2 id="基础命令"><a href="#基础命令" class="headerlink" title="基础命令"></a>基础命令</h2><h3 id="生成编译配置"><a href="#生成编译配置" class="headerlink" title="生成编译配置"></a>生成编译配置</h3><p>指定在build目录生成编译配置</p><figure class="highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs shell">cmake -B build<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="编译"><a href="#编译" class="headerlink" title="编译"></a>编译</h3><p>指定编译目录</p><figure class="highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs shell">cmake --build build<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="运行cmake脚本"><a href="#运行cmake脚本" class="headerlink" title="运行cmake脚本"></a>运行cmake脚本</h3><p>脚本模式运行，用于测试</p><figure class="highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs shell">cmake -P TestCMake.cmake<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="基础语法"><a href="#基础语法" class="headerlink" title="基础语法"></a>基础语法</h2><h3 id="变量"><a href="#变量" class="headerlink" title="变量"></a>变量</h3><p>定义变量，变量命名一般是全大写加下划线分割</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">set</span>(VAR_NAME <span class="hljs-string">&quot;varName&quot;</span>) <br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>定义缓存变量，跨文件可见</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">set</span>(VAR_NAME <span class="hljs-string">&quot;varName&quot;</span> CACHE <span class="hljs-keyword">STRING</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;注释说明&quot;</span>) <br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>变量赋值</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">set</span>(VAR_NAME_TMP <span class="hljs-variable">$&#123;VAR_NAME&#125;</span>) <br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>变量清空</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">set</span>(VAR_NAME “”) <br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>变量取消定义</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">unset</span>(VAR_NAME)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>缓存变量取消定义</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">unset</span>(VAR_NAME CACHE)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="if语句"><a href="#if语句" class="headerlink" title="if语句"></a>if语句</h3><p>条件判断</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$&#123;RESULT&#125;</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">EQUAL</span> <span class="hljs-number">1</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">elseif</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$&#123;RESULT&#125;</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">EQUAL</span> <span class="hljs-number">2</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>()<br><span class="hljs-keyword">endif</span>()<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>大于判断</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(<span class="hljs-number">2</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">GREATER</span> <span class="hljs-number">1</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">endif</span>()<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>等于判断</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(<span class="hljs-number">1</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">EQUAL</span> <span class="hljs-number">1</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">endif</span>()<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>小于判断</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(<span class="hljs-number">1</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">LESS</span> <span class="hljs-number">2</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">endif</span>()<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>大于等于判断</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(<span class="hljs-number">2</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">GREATER_EQUAL</span> <span class="hljs-number">2</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">endif</span>()<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>小于等于判断</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(<span class="hljs-number">1</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">LESS_EQUAL</span> <span class="hljs-number">2</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">endif</span>()<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>多重判断</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(<span class="hljs-number">1</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">LESS_EQUAL</span> <span class="hljs-number">2</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">AND</span> <span class="hljs-number">2</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">LESS_EQUAL</span> <span class="hljs-number">2</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">endif</span>()<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(<span class="hljs-number">1</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">LESS_EQUAL</span> <span class="hljs-number">2</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">OR</span> <span class="hljs-number">3</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">LESS_EQUAL</span> <span class="hljs-number">2</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">endif</span>()<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(<span class="hljs-keyword">NOT</span> <span class="hljs-number">3</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">LESS_EQUAL</span> <span class="hljs-number">2</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">endif</span>()<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>字符串判断</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(STRING_VAR <span class="hljs-keyword">STREQUAL</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;value&quot;</span>) <span class="hljs-comment"># 字符串相等</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(STRING_VAR <span class="hljs-keyword">MATCHES</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;pattern&quot;</span>) <span class="hljs-comment"># 字符串匹配正则</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>文件目录判断</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(<span class="hljs-keyword">EXISTS</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;/path/to/file&quot;</span>)      <span class="hljs-comment"># 文件/目录存在</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(<span class="hljs-keyword">IS_DIRECTORY</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;/path/to/dir&quot;</span>) <span class="hljs-comment"># 是目录</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="foreach语句"><a href="#foreach语句" class="headerlink" title="foreach语句"></a>foreach语句</h3><p>普通遍历</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">set</span>(ITEMS <span class="hljs-string">&quot;A&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;B&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;C&quot;</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">foreach</span>(ITEM <span class="hljs-variable">$&#123;ITEMS&#125;</span>)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">message</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;Item: $&#123;ITEM&#125;&quot;</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">endforeach</span>()    <br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>纯列表遍历</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">set</span>(LIST_ITEMS <span class="hljs-string">&quot;A&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;B&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;C&quot;</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">foreach</span>(ITEM IN LISTS LIST_ITEMS)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">message</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;Item: $&#123;ITEM&#125;&quot;</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">endforeach</span>()    <br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>循环范围</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">foreach</span>(i RANGE <span class="hljs-number">5</span>)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">message</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;i: $&#123;i&#125;&quot;</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">endforeach</span>()      <br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="while语句"><a href="#while语句" class="headerlink" title="while语句"></a>while语句</h3><p>while循环</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">set</span>(MAX_RETRY <span class="hljs-number">3</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">while</span>(MAX_RETRY <span class="hljs-keyword">GREATER</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">message</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;Try once: $&#123;MAX_RETRY&#125;&quot;</span>)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">math</span>(EXPR MAX_RETRY <span class="hljs-string">&quot;$&#123;MAX_RETRY&#125; - 1&quot;</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">endwhile</span>() <br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="函数"><a href="#函数" class="headerlink" title="函数"></a>函数</h3><p>函数定义</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-comment"># 定义函数</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span>(my_function arg1 arg2)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">message</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;Argument 1: $&#123;arg1&#125;&quot;</span>)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">message</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;Argument 2: $&#123;arg2&#125;&quot;</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">endfunction</span>()   <br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 函数调用</span><br>my_function(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;Hello&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;World&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>带返回值函数定义</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span>(get_sum arg1 arg2 result)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">math</span>(EXPR tmp <span class="hljs-string">&quot;$&#123;arg1&#125;+$&#123;arg2&#125;&quot;</span>)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">set</span>(<span class="hljs-variable">$&#123;result&#125;</span> <span class="hljs-variable">$&#123;tmp&#125;</span> PARENT_SCOPE)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">endfunction</span>()   <br><br>get_sum(<span class="hljs-number">1</span> <span class="hljs-number">2</span> RET)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">message</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;sum=:$&#123;RET&#125;&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="宏定义"><a href="#宏定义" class="headerlink" title="宏定义"></a>宏定义</h3><p>宏定义</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-comment"># 宏定义 无自己的作用域，参数是文本替换</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">macro</span>(my_macro arg1 arg2)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">message</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;Macro Argument 1: $&#123;arg1&#125;&quot;</span>)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">message</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;Macro Argument 2: $&#123;arg2&#125;&quot;</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">endmacro</span>()  <br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 调用宏</span><br>my_macro(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;Hello&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Macro&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="内置工具"><a href="#内置工具" class="headerlink" title="内置工具"></a>内置工具</h2><h3 id="列表操作"><a href="#列表操作" class="headerlink" title="列表操作"></a>列表操作</h3><p>初始化列表</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">set</span>(VAR_LIST <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Item1&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Item2&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Item3&quot;</span>)    <br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>添加元素</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">list</span>(APPEND VAR_LIST <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Item4&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Item5&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>移除列表变量中的元素，大小写敏感</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">list</span>(REMOVE_ITEM VAR_LIST <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Item2&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>获取列表长度</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">list</span>(LENGTH VAR_LIST LIST_LENGTH)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>获取列表中的元素</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">list</span>(GET VAR_LIST <span class="hljs-number">0</span> FIRST_ITEM)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="数学操作"><a href="#数学操作" class="headerlink" title="数学操作"></a>数学操作</h3><p>加减乘除</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">math</span>(EXPR result <span class="hljs-string">&quot;5 + 3&quot;</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">math</span>(EXPR result <span class="hljs-string">&quot;5 - 3&quot;</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">math</span>(EXPR result <span class="hljs-string">&quot;5 * 3&quot;</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">math</span>(EXPR result <span class="hljs-string">&quot;5 / 3&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>位运算</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">math</span>(EXPR result <span class="hljs-string">&quot;5 &lt;&lt; 3&quot;</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">math</span>(EXPR result <span class="hljs-string">&quot;5 &gt;&gt; 3&quot;</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">math</span>(EXPR result <span class="hljs-string">&quot;5 | 3&quot;</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">math</span>(EXPR result <span class="hljs-string">&quot;5 &amp; 3&quot;</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">math</span>(EXPR result <span class="hljs-string">&quot;5 ^ 3&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="字符串操作"><a href="#字符串操作" class="headerlink" title="字符串操作"></a>字符串操作</h3><p>初始化字符串</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">set</span>(VAR_STRING <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Hello, CMake!&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>添加字符串</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">string</span>(APPEND VAR_STRING <span class="hljs-string">&quot;suffix&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>获取字符串长度</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">string</span>(LENGTH <span class="hljs-variable">$&#123;VAR_STRING&#125;</span> LENGTH_VAR)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>获取字符串子串</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">string</span>(SUBSTRING <span class="hljs-variable">$&#123;VAR_STRING&#125;</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span> <span class="hljs-number">5</span> RESULT)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>转换字符串小写</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">string</span>(TOLOWER <span class="hljs-variable">$&#123;VAR_STRING&#125;</span> RESULT)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>转换字符串大写</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">string</span>(TOUPPER <span class="hljs-variable">$&#123;VAR_STRING&#125;</span> RESULT)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>替换字符串中的子串</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">string</span>(REPLACE <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Hello&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;OK&quot;</span> RESULT <span class="hljs-variable">$&#123;VAR_STRING&#125;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="输出操作"><a href="#输出操作" class="headerlink" title="输出操作"></a>输出操作</h3><p>输出消息</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">message</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;Hello, CMake&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>输出状态消息</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">message</span>(STATUS <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Hello, CMake&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>输出警告消息</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">message</span>(WARNING <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Hello, CMake&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>输出错误消息，并终止构建</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">message</span>(FATAL_ERROR <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Hello, CMake&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="SET操作"><a href="#SET操作" class="headerlink" title="SET操作"></a>SET操作</h3><p>定义普通变量</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">set</span>(VAR_NAME <span class="hljs-string">&quot;value&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>定义缓存变量, 缓存变量存储在CMakeCache.txt文件中，在整个 CMake 构建树中全局有效，可以在CMake GUI中修改</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">set</span>(VAR_NAME <span class="hljs-string">&quot;value&quot;</span> CACHE <span class="hljs-keyword">STRING</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Description&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>清除普通变量</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">set</span>(VAR_NAME <span class="hljs-string">&quot;&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>删除普通变量</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">unset</span>(VAR_NAME)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>删除缓存变量</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">unset</span>(VAR_NAME CACHE)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>定义列表变量</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">set</span>(VAR_LIST <span class="hljs-string">&quot;item1&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;item2&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;item3&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>添加新元素到列表变量</p><p>···cmake<br>set(VAR_LIST ${VAR_LIST} “item4” “item5”)<br>···</p><p>设置临时环境变量</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">set</span>(ENV&#123;MY_ENV_VAR&#125; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;some_value&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>输出环境变量</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">message</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;MY_ENV_VAR = $ENV&#123;MY_ENV_VAR&#125;&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="文件操作"><a href="#文件操作" class="headerlink" title="文件操作"></a>文件操作</h3><p>写入文件</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">file</span>(WRITE <span class="hljs-string">&quot;./BasicSyntax/Test.txt&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;content&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>读取文件</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">file</span>(READ <span class="hljs-string">&quot;./BasicSyntax/Test.txt&quot;</span> FILE_CONTENT)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>追加到文件</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">file</span>(APPEND <span class="hljs-string">&quot;./BasicSyntax/Test.txt&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;more content\n&quot;</span>)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>列出目录内容</p><figure class="highlight cmake"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cmake"><span class="hljs-keyword">file</span>(GLOB SOURCE_FILES <span class="hljs-string">&quot;$&#123;CMAKE_CURRENT_LIST_DIR&#125;/*.cmake&quot;</span>)<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">foreach</span>(<span class="hljs-keyword">FILE</span> IN LISTS SOURCE_FILES)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">message</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;Found file: $&#123;FILE&#125;&quot;</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">endforeach</span>()<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
